---
// Why choose Element Safety?
---

<section class="py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
        Why choose Element Safety?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Our commitment to excellence and comprehensive approach sets us apart in
        the safety consulting industry.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
      <!-- Expertise and Qualifications -->
      <div class="bg-blue-50 p-8 rounded-lg">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
          Expertise and Qualifications
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
          Our consultants are fully trained and certified by the Board of
          Certified Safety Professionals, ensuring every project meets the
          highest standards of compliance and care.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Speed and Reach -->
      <div class="bg-orange-50 p-8 rounded-lg">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Speed and Reach</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
          With a dedicated network of certified professionals across the U.S.,
          we can staff and support your projects quickly wherever you operate.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Simplicity -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 bg-[#F0FDF4] rounded-[15px] py-6 md:pt-[35px] px-5 md:px-[40px] md:pb-[35px] min-h-fit md:min-h-[200px] flex flex-col items-start gap-[15px] font-sans">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start w-full">
    
    <div class="w-full">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 tracking-wide">
        Simplicity
      </h3>
      <p class="text-[17px] text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        We handle every part of your safety staffing process <br>
        <strong class="text-slate-800 font-semibold">recruiting and vetting, payroll, insurance, and compliance checks</strong>, 
        so you can focus on your business.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-600 mb-4 tracking-wide">
        Save Time & Costs By:
      </h3>
      <ul class="text-[17px] text-slate-600 space-y-2">
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <span class="mr-2 select-none">•</span>
          <span>Avoiding payroll taxes and HR overhead</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <span class="mr-2 select-none">•</span>
          <span>Reducing workers’ comp and benefits expenses</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <span class="mr-2 select-none">•</span>
          <span>Getting insured, pre-screened professionals ready to start</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <span class="mr-2 select-none">•</span>
          <span>Replacing unavailable consultants immediately zero downtime</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
    </div>
